1
00:00:00,977 --> 00:00:03,857
(Leonard:)So, listen, there was something
I was hoping to float past you.

2
00:00:04,514 --> 00:00:06,154
(Leonard:)Now that Penny and I are engaged,

3
00:00:06,316 --> 00:00:08,696
(Leonard:)I thought we might want to talk
about our living arrangements.

4
00:00:09,786 --> 00:00:10,826
(Sheldon:)Of course.

5
00:00:10,987 --> 00:00:13,797
(Sheldon:)She's spent many nights here,
and you're worried

6
00:00:13,957 --> 00:00:17,967
(Sheldon:)about preserving the myth
of her virginity before the wedding.

7
00:00:21,297 --> 00:00:22,337
(Leonard:)-I'm not.
-Good,

8
00:00:22,498 --> 00:00:23,708
(Sheldon:)because not only
has that ship sailed,

9
00:00:23,866 --> 00:00:26,706
(Sheldon:)if it hit an iceberg,
countless men would perish.

10
00:00:29,105 --> 00:00:31,275
(Leonard:)Actually, this is about
where she and I are going to live.

11
00:00:31,441 --> 00:00:32,891
(Sheldon:)What do you mean?

12
00:00:33,042 --> 00:00:35,882
(Leonard:)Well, well, we might
want to live together.

13
00:00:36,045 --> 00:00:39,215
(Sheldon:)Oh, yeah, well, I've already
given this some thought,

14
00:00:39,382 --> 00:00:43,852
(Sheldon:)and I'm willing
to let Penny live with us

15
00:00:44,020 --> 00:00:46,470
(Sheldon:)one day a week for a trial period.

16
00:00:48,391 --> 00:00:51,301
(Sheldon:)Now, obviously,
not when she's made cranky

17
00:00:51,461 --> 00:00:54,241
(Sheldon:)by the shedding
of her uterine lining.

18
00:00:56,299 --> 00:00:59,019
(Leonard:)That's very sweet.

